      "instructions": "1. Lie supine, knees lifted off the floor.\n2. Rest the hands behind the head.\n3. Raise the shoulders and rotate toward one knee.\n4. Come back, then rotate toward the other knee.\n5. Move slowly and keep the low back on the floor.",
